flowchart TD
    A[User pastes LeetCode URL] --> B[POST /api/coding/import-url]
    B --> C[Fetch URL content]
    C --> D[Parse HTML\nextract title, difficulty, statement,\nexamples, constraints, tags]
    D --> E[Return structured problem JSON]
    E --> F[codingStore.setProblem]
    F --> G[ProblemPanel renders statement]
    G --> H[AICoachPanel gets problem context]